{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳奕迅（Eason）宣布將於今年12月至明年2月，在香港演藝學院歌劇院舉行一連26場《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan 與陳奕迅一起錄音》。</p><p>陳奕迅是次演出並非一般演唱會，而是他策劃的香港樂壇史無前例大型唱片重錄工程。</p><p>他將錄音室搬上舞台，首次以現場公開錄音形式邀請歌迷親身參與，見證經典歌曲重新誕生。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:59:24.525759+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:11:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:57:41.083229+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:57:41.083229+00:00","content_hash":"612dee85867d8425411b99e825b1c4ee2421dbb654028e34a1b7b4102bdac857","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}